-- programme while retaining the repo's anti-collapse discipline.
--
-- Main facts:
--
--   * the ten-state completion carrier is intrinsically 9 + 1, not a decimal
--     glyph artefact;
--   * the SAME finite ten-state carrier also admits an exact 5 x 2
--     complement-mode/binary-phase chart;
--   * the existing D4-irrep x orientation carrier is C2-equivariantly
--     equivalent to that 9+1 completion carrier;
--   * the Base369 Fine10 macro carrier is explicitly two-sided equivalent to
--     the completion carrier, but actual Monster multiplicity-action
--     recognition remains a separate theorem;
--   * rank indexing is extended from 0..13 to 0..17;
--   * 13 -> 14 is the first positive three-balanced-trit carry boundary:
--
--         13 = (111)_balanced
--         14 = (1 -1 -1 -1)_balanced;
--
--   * rank 14 and rank 17 are retained as numerical/filtration coordinates
--     for the sourced Monster 3-local exponent patterns 2+6+6 and 3+2+6+6;
--   * arbitrary ternary rank fibres are finite combinatorial pants paths;
--   * stage-12 relation formation A12 x A12 = 144 is kept separate from
--     successor, ternary refinement, regular-C3 expansion and oriented product;
--   * signed SSP/FRACTRAN remains a fine fibre over the coarse C3 phase.
------------------------------------------------------------------------

